    "description": "<p>You unleash a shaft of intensely bright light that burns through whatever it touches.</p><p>Choose a target within<strong> 30 spaces</strong>. It takes <strong>1 Damage</strong>, and most make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or be <strong>Blinded</strong> until the beginning of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the duration of the <strong>Blinded</strong> condition by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.wTcmSUVW6ndw5rJW]{Brilliant Lance}</p>",
